  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0:\n            - Initial release with abstract base classes for CQRS pattern implementation\n            - Result pattern implementation for standardized response handling\n            - Request and Notification base classes with automatic ID generation\n            - RequestHandler and NotificationBehavior abstract implementations\n            - RequestBehavior base class for pipeline behaviors\n            - Comprehensive error handling and success/failure result patterns",
